     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You know 85 has a factor of 5 because it ends in 5.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"85 = 5 \\times 17\"></span></p>\n<p>Because 17 is a prime number, you are done.</p>"
